# CRR workspace layout

This folder is the production website (`CRRrvPark/CRR-RV-Park-Website`). Netlify deploys from this repo only.

Campaign work (Google Ads, copy decks, CSVs, launch notes) lives in the sibling workspace folder **Marketing** (`rv-park-marketing`). Do not add ads assets here. Do not treat that folder as a git submodule of this repo.

When a task is conversion copy, landing pages, tracking, or site UX, work in this folder. When it is campaign setup or channel collateral, work in Marketing.
